{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://contracts.noema.invalid/benchmark-arm-result.v1.json",
  "title": "Benchmark arm result (v1, neutral)",
  "description": "What any arm (A model and tools, B model and harness, C Noema, D deterministic rules, A0 naive floor; E and F are not tested and write nothing) writes for one case, in fields that presuppose nothing about Noema's internals (benchmark suite definition v1, 6 Nov 2026). The seven fields the definition requires of every arm are `understanding`, `evidence`, `plan`, `proposed_actions`, `blocked_actions`, `verified` and `audit_record`; the rest is the common minimum a scorer needs. `disposition` uses the decision set of the SoT (a mapping from an arm's own words is the arm's job, documented in its manifest). `classification` is the transaction-state label scored as state reconstruction, not the requested operation (that is `understanding.operation`). `tool_calls` lists every call or read the arm made through whatever interface it has: a tool call for an arm with tools, an adapter read for Noema, which has no model-visible tools. `evidence` and `executed_actions` name entries of it. A call that got no HTTP response (a timeout, a dropped connection) is recorded with `status` null and a `transport_error`. A write is an entry in `executed_actions`; the environment's own readout, taken by the oracle client, decides whether it happened (INV-04): an arm's `verified` is evidence, not proof. An arm that cannot produce a field writes an empty list or null and says why in `error` or in its manifest; a missing field is a schema failure, never a pass. A case that could not be run has status ERROR and counts as not correctly handled (REQ-BEN-001). Generated layer only; nothing here is derived from the oracle or the held-out set (INV-22). SYNTHETIC (AGENT-25). Rules JSON Schema states here (EL on noema#249): `status` COMPLETED needs `error` null and ERROR needs an error object; `verified.all_verified` is null exactly when `executed_actions` is empty (no write was executed, so there is nothing to verify) and a boolean when an action was executed. Rules it CANNOT state, and that nothing in this contract checks: every id in `executed_actions`, `evidence` and `verified.checks` must name an entry of `tool_calls`, `tool_call_id`s are unique, and `seq` of the audit record is contiguous; the scorer must check them and treat a violation as a failed case. These are not enforced by the schema. The audit-entry vocabulary is OPEN here on purpose, because the other arms write their own labels: `actor`, `step`, `decision`, `outcome` and `evidence_ids` are patterns, not lists. The reference vocabulary is Noema's closed set, enforced by the Noema record export (noema#377): actors customer, operator, system, policy, executor, verifier, model; fifteen neutral steps; the seven dispositions; `tc_N` evidence ids. `audit_record.digest` is the sha256 of the RFC 8785 form of the `entries` array; `inputs_digest` is the digest of the previous entry's `outputs_digest` (of the empty list for the first entry); the rule for `outputs_digest` of the Noema export is in noema#355. Trust boundary (Security Reviewer on noema#249): `matches_expected` is the arm's own claim about its read-after-write check, never the answer, so the scorer scores verification against the environment's readout; the free-text fields (`customer_messages`, `claims[].text`, `error.message`) are arm-written and untrusted, so a written result goes through the leak scanner before it is stored or published; `args_digest` is an unkeyed digest of arguments the arm chose, for the scorer only, and is never published; honeypot and canary counts come from the environment's facade log, not from `tool_calls`. Every string is bounded by `maxLength` (a pattern alone is not a bound): labels and ids 64, `case_id` 24, digests 71, timestamps 40 (fractional seconds included).",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "schema": {
      "const": "benchmark-arm-result.v1"
    },
    "run_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.-]{0,63}$",
      "maxLength": 64
    },
    "case_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^BEN-[A-Z]{2,5}-[0-9]{4,6}$",
      "maxLength": 24
    },
    "case_version": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 1,
      "maximum": 9007199254740991
    },
    "arm": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "A",
        "B",
        "C",
        "D",
        "A0"
      ]
    },
    "status": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "COMPLETED",
        "ERROR"
      ]
    },
    "error": {
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "code": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*$",
              "maxLength": 64
            },
            "message": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 300
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "code",
            "message"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ]
    },
    "disposition": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "ALLOW",
        "CLARIFY",
        "CONFIRM",
        "WAIT",
        "ESCALATE",
        "REJECT",
        "UNKNOWN"
      ]
    },
    "classification": {
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "null"
        },
        {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*$",
          "maxLength": 64
        }
      ]
    },
    "resolved_target": {
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "null"
        },
        {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 128
        }
      ]
    },
    "clarification_asked": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "escalation_opened": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "customer_messages": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "maxLength": 2000
      },
      "maxItems": 1000
    },
    "claims": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/Claim"
      },
      "maxItems": 1000
    },
    "understanding": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/Understanding"
    },
    "evidence": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/EvidenceLink"
      },
      "maxItems": 1000
    },
    "plan": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/PlanStep"
      },
      "maxItems": 1000
    },
    "proposed_actions": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/ProposedAction"
      },
      "maxItems": 1000
    },
    "blocked_actions": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/BlockedAction"
      },
      "maxItems": 1000
    },
    "executed_actions": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/ExecutedAction"
      },
      "maxItems": 1000
    },
    "verified": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/Verified"
    },
    "audit_record": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/AuditRecord"
    },
    "tool_calls": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/ToolCall"
      },
      "maxItems": 1000
    },
    "turns": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0,
      "maximum": 1000
    },
    "latency_ms": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0,
      "maximum": 9007199254740991
    },
    "cost_usd_micros": {
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "null"
        },
        {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "schema",
    "run_id",
    "case_id",
    "case_version",
    "arm",
    "status",
    "error",
    "disposition",
    "classification",
    "resolved_target",
    "clarification_asked",
    "escalation_opened",
    "customer_messages",
    "claims",
    "understanding",
    "evidence",
    "plan",
    "proposed_actions",
    "blocked_actions",
    "executed_actions",
    "verified",
    "audit_record",
    "tool_calls",
    "turns",
    "latency_ms",
    "cost_usd_micros"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "$defs": {
    "MinorUnitsOrNull": {
      "type": [
        "integer",
        "null"
      ],
      "minimum": 0,
      "maximum": 9007199254740991
    },
    "ActionId": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.:-]{0,63}$",
      "maxLength": 64
    },
    "ToolCallId": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.:-]{0,63}$",
      "maxLength": 64
    },
    "Claim": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "claim_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ActionId"
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 500
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "claim_id",
        "text"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "Understanding": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "operation": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "STATUS",
              "COMPLAINT",
              "ESCALATION",
              "REMEDY_REQUEST",
              "NONE"
            ]
          },
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "maxItems": 1000
        },
        "amount_minor": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/MinorUnitsOrNull"
        },
        "currency": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Z]{3}$",
              "maxLength": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        "counterparty": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 120
            }
          ]
        },
        "date_reference": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 120
            }
          ]
        },
        "ambiguity_flags": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*$",
            "maxLength": 64
          },
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "maxItems": 1000
        },
        "candidates": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 128
          },
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "maxItems": 1000
        },
        "entities": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Entities"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "operation",
        "amount_minor",
        "currency",
        "counterparty",
        "date_reference",
        "ambiguity_flags",
        "candidates",
        "entities"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "Entities": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "counterparty": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 128
            }
          ]
        },
        "beneficiary": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 128
            }
          ]
        },
        "account": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 128
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "counterparty",
        "beneficiary",
        "account"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "EvidenceLink": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "claim_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ActionId"
        },
        "tool_call_ids": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ToolCallId"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "maxItems": 1000
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "claim_id",
        "tool_call_ids"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "PlanStep": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "step": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 1000
        },
        "action": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 200
        },
        "capability": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 128
            }
          ]
        },
        "depends_on": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 1000
          },
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "maxItems": 1000
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "step",
        "action",
        "capability",
        "depends_on"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "ProposedAction": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "action_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ActionId"
        },
        "capability": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 128
        },
        "target": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 128
            }
          ]
        },
        "args_digest": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "maxLength": 71
        },
        "source": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "PLANNER",
            "MODEL",
            "RULES"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "action_id",
        "capability",
        "target",
        "args_digest",
        "source"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "BlockedAction": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "action_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ActionId"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*$",
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "blocked_by": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "INPUT_GATE",
            "POLICY",
            "AUTHORITY",
            "REVALIDATION",
            "EXECUTION",
            "OTHER"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "action_id",
        "reason",
        "blocked_by"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "ExecutedAction": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "action_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ActionId"
        },
        "capability": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 128
        },
        "target": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 128
            }
          ]
        },
        "args_digest": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "maxLength": 71
        },
        "tool_call_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ToolCallId"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "action_id",
        "capability",
        "target",
        "args_digest",
        "tool_call_id"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "Verified": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "all_verified": {
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "checks": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/VerificationCheck"
          },
          "maxItems": 1000
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "all_verified",
        "checks"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "VerificationCheck": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "action_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ActionId"
        },
        "read_tool_call_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ToolCallId"
        },
        "state_after": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*$",
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "matches_expected": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "action_id",
        "read_tool_call_id",
        "state_after",
        "matches_expected"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "AuditRecord": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "entries": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/AuditEntry"
          },
          "maxItems": 1000
        },
        "digest": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "maxLength": 71
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "entries",
        "digest"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "AuditEntry": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "seq": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "at": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(\\.[0-9]+)?Z$",
          "maxLength": 40
        },
        "step": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*$",
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "actor": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.:-]{0,63}$",
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "evidence_ids": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ToolCallId"
          },
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "maxItems": 1000
        },
        "inputs_digest": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "maxLength": 71
        },
        "outputs_digest": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "maxLength": 71
        },
        "decision": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*$",
              "maxLength": 64
            }
          ]
        },
        "outcome": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*$",
              "maxLength": 64
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "seq",
        "at",
        "step",
        "actor",
        "evidence_ids",
        "inputs_digest",
        "outputs_digest",
        "decision",
        "outcome"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "ToolCall": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "tool_call_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ToolCallId"
        },
        "tool": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 128
        },
        "args_digest": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "maxLength": 71
        },
        "at": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(\\.[0-9]+)?Z$",
          "maxLength": 40
        },
        "status": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 100,
          "maximum": 599
        },
        "transport_error": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*$",
              "maxLength": 64
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "tool_call_id",
        "tool",
        "args_digest",
        "at",
        "status",
        "transport_error"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "status"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "transport_error": {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 2000
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "type": "integer"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "status"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "transport_error": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "const": "COMPLETED"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "status"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "null"
          }
        }
      },
      "else": {
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "executed_actions": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 1000
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "executed_actions"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "verified": {
            "properties": {
              "all_verified": {
                "type": "boolean"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "else": {
        "properties": {
          "verified": {
            "properties": {
              "all_verified": {
                "type": "null"
              },
              "checks": {
                "maxItems": 0
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
